   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Response to the impact of Hurricane Ian in western provinces of Pinar del Rio and Artemisa, Cuba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide health assistance to communities affected by Hurricane Ian in Western Cuba. This WHO project provides health services to vulnerable people. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 566,875 people, including 229,493 women, 229,247 men, 108,135 children, and including 8,503 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
